Q: Duplicate ID, tag null, or parent id with another fragment for com.google.android.gms.maps.MapFragment A: <p>Declare SupportMapFragment object globally</p>
<pre><code>    private SupportMapFragment mapFragment;
</code></pre>
<p>In onCreateView() method put below code</p>
<pre><code>mapFragment = (SupportMapFragment) getChildFragmentManager()
            .findFragmentById(R.id.map);
 mapFragment.getMapAsync(this);
</code></pre>
<p>In onDestroyView() put below code</p>
<pre><code>@Override
public void onDestroyView() {
   super.onDestroyView();

    if (mapFragment != null)
        getFragmentManager().beginTransaction().remove(mapFragment).commit();
}
</code></pre>
<p>In your xml file put below code</p>
<pre><code> &lt;fragment
    android:id=&quot;@+id/map&quot;
    android:name=&quot;com.abc.Driver.fragment.FragmentHome&quot;
    class=&quot;com.google.android.gms.maps.SupportMapFragment&quot;
    android:layout_width=&quot;match_parent&quot;
    android:layout_height=&quot;match_parent&quot;
    /&gt;
</code></pre>
